    "summaries": [
      {
        "action_date": "2025-03-18",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Restore Protections for Dialysis Patients Act</strong></p><p>This bill specifies certain requirements for private health insurers regarding coverage of individuals with end stage renal disease (ESRD) who are also covered under Medicare.&nbsp;</p><p>In particular, the bill specifies that insurers may not limit benefits, including limiting network composition, in a manner that will affect ESRD Medicare beneficiaries differently compared to others without ESRD. The bill additionally specifies that insurers are not required to include a particular renal dialysis provider or a particular number of such providers as part of their networks.&nbsp;</p>",
        "update_date": "2026-03-20T19:18:18Z"
      }
    ]
  },
